Request: do not train on the cases
----------------------------------
GuardrailBench is a test set. Training on it makes the scores meaningless.
We ask that nobody include the cases in training, fine-tuning, or
tuning data for any model or guard product.

Every case carries a unique canary string that starts with "GRB-CANARY-".
Please do not remove it. If you build a training corpus, filter out any
document that contains the string "GRB-CANARY-". Maintainers may scan
models and products for these strings and publish the result.

This request is a strong norm, not an extra license condition.
